    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc913169ee2b9f3d1e62752b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后甚至诞生了“#富士失落症”这种词汇，\n人人开始引颈期盼她接下来的表现……\n此时，某一天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e1ac86cdc34da57b19e61d0c1eef6e628c78db354c02ed2ef0c9299afd6b339",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
