    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88c74d2a534d99cdf118ae4c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "富士奇石面带笑容挥着手送后辈离开。\n她刚刚心不在焉的模样让我有些在意，但──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c26affea96e20317003d5fd35a91963841a88a0d5e6ec53212d735cc9e73e0b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
