    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fdd00f21cb88d5e59a648e9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……看到她展现前所未有的高昂态度，\n让我实在无法出言反对。\n更重要的是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac67db3cd6f287d2ff3013d2bd5c0c49c32406747f49e8ace5919f50bbc079c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005114.json",
      "json_path": [
